On Sun, Sep 13, 2009 at 12:03:59PM +0100, Rafa dv wrote:
> Hello all,
> 
> Just a quick question. Who should I contact in regards to a Linux
> kernel security bug?

Either you think it's not particularly serious and you can talk about it
here, or you prefer to restrict discussion about it in a small committee
before it gets fixed, and you can mail security@kernel.org for that
purpose.

If there's a known maintainer for the subsystem affected by this bug, it
may help to CC him too.

Regards,
Willy

